VALUES ('ENG-002', 'BS Aircraft Maintenance Technology', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['UAE', 'Qatar', 'Singapore'], FALSE, 'CAAP Aircraft Maintenance Engineer License', 4, 'Get CAAP license first, then immediately pursue EASA Part 66 B1 or B2 type rating conversion to unlock European airline opportunities.', 'CAAP license is recognized by Gulf airlines; Emirates and Etihad actively recruit Filipino AMTs. EASA Part 66 B1/B2 conversion opens European and global pathways.')
