VALUES ('ENG-003', 'BS Aviation Related Programs', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['UAE', 'Singapore', 'Australia'], FALSE, 'CAAP Licensed (varies by specialization)', 4, 'Identify your specific track early (safety officer, dispatcher, avionics, airport ops) and pursue the corresponding CAAP/ICAO certification before graduating.', 'Covers broad aviation specializations beyond AMT; Gulf aviation expansion (UAE, Qatar, Saudi) sustains strong demand for Filipino aviation professionals across MRO, safety, and operations roles.')
