VALUES ('ENG-008', 'BS Electrical Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Very High', ARRAY['UAE', 'USA', 'Canada'], TRUE, 'Electrical Engineer Licensure Exam (PRC EE board)', 5, 'Get your PRC EE license, then pursue UAE DEWA/ADNOC pre-qualification or Australian Engineers Australia skills assessment simultaneously to open two high-paying markets at once.', 'BLS median EE salary $125,100 (May 2025). UAE construction and power sector pays AED 10,000—18,000/mo tax-free. Australia MLTSSL listed. Canada NOC 22310. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 aids recognition.')
