VALUES ('ENG-009', 'BS Electronics Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Very High', ARRAY['Taiwan', 'South Korea', 'Japan'], TRUE, 'Electronics Engineer Licensure Exam (ECE board)', 5, 'Specialize in semiconductor process, VLSI design, or RF/communications. Taiwan (TSMC/MediaTek) fastest-growing destination with high starting salaries relative to cost of living.', 'Semiconductor supercycle driving demand in Taiwan, South Korea, Japan, Germany, Netherlands. TSMC, Samsung, Intel, ASML top employers. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 - mutual recognition in 21 countries.')
