VALUES ('ENG-010', 'BS Engineering Technology', 'Engineering & Technology', 'DOMESTIC', 'Low', ARRAY['Philippines', 'Saudi Arabia', 'UAE'], FALSE, NULL, 4, 'Consider pursuing a BS in a licensed engineering discipline afterward, or build a career in technical training and TESDA assessment centers where this degree is well-recognized.', 'Primarily a domestic qualification; limited international recognition compared to BS Engineering degrees. Best pathway is to use the degree as a stepping stone to licensed engineering programs or TESDA-aligned technical supervision roles.')
