VALUES ('ENG-011', 'BS Food Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['Canada', 'Netherlands', 'Australia'], FALSE, NULL, 5, 'Get an ISO 22000 Food Safety Management Systems lead auditor certificate before graduating — it''s a globally recognized credential that food multinationals specifically require.', 'Global food security concerns and food tech innovation drive sustained demand. Netherlands (Wageningen, Unilever, FrieslandCampina) and Singapore (food security hub) are strategic targets. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 aids recognition.')
