VALUES ('ENG-012', 'BS Geodetic Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['Australia', 'UAE', 'Canada'], TRUE, 'Geodetic Engineer Licensure Exam (GELE)', 5, 'Australia is the highest-value destination - average $142k and surveyor shortage until at least 2029. Start Engineers Australia CDR immediately after board exam.', 'Australia projects 2,000-person surveyor deficit by 2029 - VERY HIGH demand. AUD 142k average with FIFO/mining premium up to AUD 200k. UAE construction boom strong for Filipino geodetic engineers.')
