VALUES ('ENG-013', 'BS Industrial Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Very High', ARRAY['USA', 'Canada', 'Germany'], TRUE, 'Industrial Engineer Licensure Exam (PRC IE board)', 5, 'Earn your Lean Six Sigma Green Belt or Black Belt certification before graduating — it''s the single most transferable credential for industrial engineers across all international markets.', 'BLS median IE salary $101,140 (May 2024); projected 11% job growth 2024-2034 (much faster than average). Versatile degree applicable across manufacturing, logistics, healthcare, and tech. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 aids recognition.')
