VALUES ('ENG-016', 'BS Materials Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['South Korea', 'Germany', 'USA'], FALSE, NULL, 5, 'Focus your thesis on battery materials (lithium-ion cathode/anode) or semiconductor process materials — these are the two highest-demand specializations globally for materials engineers through 2030.', 'EV battery supply chain (South Korea, Germany, USA) and semiconductor materials demand are key growth drivers. BLS classifies under Materials Engineers; median ~$100k USA. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 membership aids recognition.')
