VALUES ('ENG-020', 'BS Metallurgical Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['Australia', 'Canada', 'Norway'], TRUE, 'Metallurgical Engineer Licensure Exam (MetLE)', 5, 'Hydrometallurgy specialization (lithium/nickel processing for EV batteries) is fastest-growing premium skill globally - learn this alongside your degree.', 'EV battery supply chain (lithium, nickel, cobalt hydrometallurgy) is new growth driver. Australia and Canada mining most accessible. Norway highest paying. AusIMM is key professional pathway for Australia.')
