VALUES ('ENG-023', 'BS Robotics Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Very High', ARRAY['USA', 'Germany', 'Japan'], FALSE, NULL, 4, 'Build an open-source ROS project on GitHub and compete in regional robotics competitions — international companies (ABB, FANUC, Boston Dynamics) actively recruit from competition results and GitHub portfolios.', 'Fastest-growing engineering specialization globally; robotics demand spans manufacturing automation, surgical robotics, autonomous vehicles, logistics, and defense. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 aids recognition.')
