VALUES ('ENG-024', 'BS Sanitary Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Moderate', ARRAY['Australia', 'Canada', 'UAE'], TRUE, 'Sanitary Engineer Licensure Exam (PRC Sanitary Engineer board)', 5, 'Supplement your PRC license with a WHO-recognized WASH (Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene) specialist certification to open doors to UN agencies, ADB, and World Bank-funded water projects globally.', 'Australia average sanitary engineer salary AUD 139,376/yr (up to AUD 169,899 in Sydney per ERI 2025). Strong alignment with WHO/UNICEF WASH programs in developing regions. Growing demand from climate-related water infrastructure investment.')
