VALUES ('TEA-003', 'BS Secondary Education', 'Teacher Education', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['UK', 'UAE', 'USA'], TRUE, 'Licensure Exam for Teachers (LET) - Secondary', 4, 'Specialize in Math, Science, or SPED - these subjects command premium demand globally. Apply for UK QTS before departure to streamline school sponsorship.', 'UK QTS now free for eligible overseas teachers from August 2025 - significant change. NZ Green List covers secondary teachers to PR. STEM subject teachers in highest demand globally. Korea E-2 visa explicitly EXCLUDES Filipino citizens.')
