VALUES ('ENG-025', 'BS Structural Engineering', 'Engineering & Technology', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['UAE', 'Australia', 'UK'], FALSE, 'None (Civil Engineer board covers structural; CE license required for PH practice)', 5, 'Become proficient in ETABS and SAP2000 and pursue an IStructE (Institution of Structural Engineers) Associate Membership — this UK credential is recognized across the Gulf and Commonwealth countries.', 'Gulf giga-projects (NEOM, Saudi Vision 2030, Dubai Expo legacy) sustain high demand for structural engineers. UK CEng pathway via IStructE. Australia Skilled Independent 189 pathway. USA PE exam required for licensure. Philippines Washington Accord 2023 aids recognition.')
