VALUES ('HLT-001', 'Doctor of Dental Medicine', 'Health Professions', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'High', ARRAY['Saudi Arabia', 'UAE', 'Australia', 'UK', 'Canada'], TRUE, 'Dentist Licensure Exam', 6, 'Target Gulf countries first for fastest entry; pursue ADC/GDC route for long-term settlement in Australia or UK.', 'Gulf (Saudi, UAE, Qatar) accepts PH DMD with DataFlow + Prometric exam. Australia requires ADC written + practical exam (multi-year process). UK requires ORE (Overseas Registration Exam) via GDC. Strong demand in Gulf under Vision 2030 hospital expansions. USA pathway extremely difficult — requires re-doing a US dental program.')
