VALUES ('OTH-008', 'Doctor of Medicine', 'Health Professions', 'INTERNATIONAL', 'Very High', ARRAY['Saudi Arabia', 'UK', 'USA'], TRUE, 'Physician Licensure Exam (PLE/MLE)', 6, 'Start USMLE Step 1 prep in 3rd-4th year. If already a specialist, Gulf is fastest high-income route. Target Internal Medicine or Family Medicine for best IMG match rates.', 'Highest ceiling of any health course ($200k-$600k USA attending) but 5-10 years post-graduation. Gulf allows immediate specialist practice without re-residency. Best IMG specialties for USA: IM, FM, Psychiatry, Pathology.')
